- A cashier can record a payment.
- A receipt is generated.
- Partial payments update balances correctly.
- Duplicate payment requests are prevented.
- Payment reversals preserve history.
- Refunds require appropriate authorization.
- Reports reconcile with transaction records.

### Parent and student tests
- A parent can access only verified linked children.
- A parent cannot access another student's records.
- A student can access only their own records.
- Revoked guardian access is enforced.
- Unpublished results remain unavailable.

