Deliver a secure, reliable, professional and maintainable **Mwanaweika School Management System** that can support the real administrative, academic, financial and operational needs of a Ugandan school.

Prioritize correctness, security, data integrity, usability and maintainability over the number of screens or the speed at which code is generated.

Build a school management system that works in practice, not just one that looks impressive in screenshots.